 you know with this one it's just i'm  over the boom with it if you have a  standard laptop  that you listen to the internal dacs and  those things may be okay but they just  have no volume  a lot of them also have high impedance  and they also pick up noise from the pc  sometimes  just get this thing plug it in takes no  space this little thing  you know hanging in there you should  give you far better performance than  you get on the baseboard motherboard  even on a desktop if it comes for the  headphone output they're usually  pretty janky uh get this it just would  be fantastic  on uh with your phone and a tablet it's  just a  it's a live server you basically can  have your desktop life  on the go or even sitting at your  desktop  with this little thing and doesn't need  an external brick  or ac power or anything you just plug it  in in line  on if you're running on battery though i  suspect it'll suck the juices out dry  so i don't know how useful it is in that  scenario i'll have to measure it or you  need to ask on the forum people have it  so  you know what the battery life is you  can always turn it down and not use as  much power  on this thing so a wonderful little find  is you know state-of-the-art dac  performance in a tiny little package  with somebody who understood engineering  and did a great job designing this so  can't recommend it enough uh yeah 120  dollars a lot of money but hey  stop buying those expensive  coffee and you're not going out anyway  with the  pandemic going on so see the money that  you save  put it towards good good audio product  that uh give you a lot of enjoyment  okay that's it see you in a future video  bye bye

